{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25800","headline":"忆万岁楼望金山 · 李绅","name":"忆万岁楼望金山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼高雉堞千师垒，峰拔惊波万壑攒。\n山绝地维消虎踞，水浮天险尚龙盘。\n蜃嘘云拱飞江岛，鳌喷仙岩隔海澜。\n长对碧波临古渡，几经风月与悲欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}